OL,3,GNEWSAMissing girl search led police to
OL,4,Asex offender
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was arrested when a missing
OL,7,Fteenage girl was found at his home has
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to a string of child sex
OL,9,Foffences.
OL,11,FAfter a missing person report was filed
OL,12,Fin the West Midlands in January,
OL,13,Fanalysis of phone data led officers
OL,14,Ffrom Derbyshire Police to the Heanor
OL,15,Fhome of Richard Tate.
OL,17,FThe 42-year-old was arrested and a
OL,18,Fmobile hidden in a box in his bedroom
OL,19,Fwas found to contain indecent images
OL,20,Fand videos of children.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
